cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Sickle Cell Disease in California: 2026 Surveillance Report — Methods"
message: >-
  This repository documents how the metrics in "Sickle Cell Disease in
  California: 2026 Surveillance Report" are defined and calculated. If you are
  citing findings rather than methods, cite the report itself.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: California Sickle Cell Data Collection (CA-SCDC), Tracking California
abstract: >-
  Definitions, data dictionary and diagnosis, procedure and medication code
  lists underlying "Sickle Cell Disease in California: 2026 Surveillance
  Report". Covers the linked data sources, the case definition and surveillance
  cohort, the population and coverage definitions applied across metrics, and a
  catalogue mapping each published table and figure to the variables behind it.
keywords:
  - sickle cell disease
  - public health surveillance
  - California
  - data dictionary
  - methods
license: CC-BY-4.0
